      <activity id="203842b1-9f8c-5e35-8d79-1a5af93eb8ba" activityNameId="2fb6cf4a-1205-55d4-acef-94fee741d828" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, helicopter, single-engine, LTO cycle</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, helicopter, single-engine, LTO cycle
One take-over and landing of an helikopter, using specific emission factors for an ecureuil-as-350-b3 helicopter provided of the federal office of civil aviation (FOCCA);
UUID: 9771bae1-b20e-31ac-a7f7-976025d085b8
This dataset describes the energy requirements and emissions of a Landing-and-Take-Over (LTO) Cycle of a helicopter.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Data is for an average Swiss helicopter for observation flights (1280kg) using kerosene
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: 0LTO
Sampling: Statistics 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9771bae1-b20e-31ac-a7f7-976025d085b8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
